        "created_at": "2011-12-15T02:45:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Actually, I’d vote for a 10-point scale for that same reason. (Not that I really get a vote.) If you give people a middle point, they’re likely to choose it unusually often, which’ll mess with your data. Force people to pick between slightly-above and slightly-below the middle.</p>",
